    "detailed_description": "STREAM WAR is an streaming-based game that allows viewers of live broadcasts to participate through comments.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Deathmatch Mode</h2>A new mode, Deathmatch Mode, has been added. In this mode, viewers can participate by using the &quot;!join&quot; command while watching the stream on twitch.tv. Characters with the names of participating viewers will fight with weapons until only one person remains.<br>The maximum number of participating viewers depends on the playing environment and can be specified in the tens of thousands. Enjoy Deathmatch Mode with a large number of viewers.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2016960/extras/b92810cf11937e57d812586d970b1246.avif?t=1689506741\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Team Mode </h2>Streamers can link their Twitch account to this game with one click.<br>Viewers join this game by commands in twitch comments to spawn characters. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2016960/extras/755f95796a2611140f6d40739660e013.avif?t=1689506741\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2016960/extras/1db9068cba51b2692f17fde61c26585d.avif?t=1689506741\" /></div><br><br>A character with viewer's name will spawn when they join.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2016960/extras/ba484d3062ce241f94c4a74292cfa263.avif?t=1689506741\" /></div><br><br>Each teams fight until one of them is wiped out.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2016960/extras/f0ce2521ce6ace13a8d6f2f0a8b9403d.poster.avif?t=1689506741\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2016960/extras/f0ce2521ce6ace13a8d6f2f0a8b9403d.webm?t=1689506741\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2016960/extras/f0ce2521ce6ace13a8d6f2f0a8b9403d.mp4?t=1689506741\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2016960/extras/b09be27ca95b783340babf29a7d6188d.avif?t=1689506741\" /></div><br><br>Viewers can also use the !bomb command to drop bombs on the battlefield during combat and the !cam command to change viewpoint. <br>Winning viewers can increase their in-game points and compete for rankings.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2016960/extras/0274b6cad46d7185dc08f99a889903ab.avif?t=1689506741\" /></div>",
    "about_the_game": "STREAM WAR is an streaming-based game that allows viewers of live broadcasts to participate through comments.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Deathmatch Mode</h2>A new mode, Deathmatch Mode, has been added. In this mode, viewers can participate by using the &quot;!join&quot; command while watching the stream on twitch.tv. Characters with the names of participating viewers will fight with weapons until only one person remains.<br>The maximum number of participating viewers depends on the playing environment and can be specified in the tens of thousands. Enjoy Deathmatch Mode with a large number of viewers.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2016960/extras/b92810cf11937e57d812586d970b1246.avif?t=1689506741\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Team Mode </h2>Streamers can link their Twitch account to this game with one click.<br>Viewers join this game by commands in twitch comments to spawn characters. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2016960/extras/755f95796a2611140f6d40739660e013.avif?t=1689506741\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2016960/extras/1db9068cba51b2692f17fde61c26585d.avif?t=1689506741\" /></div><br><br>A character with viewer's name will spawn when they join.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2016960/extras/ba484d3062ce241f94c4a74292cfa263.avif?t=1689506741\" /></div><br><br>Each teams fight until one of them is wiped out.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2016960/extras/f0ce2521ce6ace13a8d6f2f0a8b9403d.poster.avif?t=1689506741\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2016960/extras/f0ce2521ce6ace13a8d6f2f0a8b9403d.webm?t=1689506741\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2016960/extras/f0ce2521ce6ace13a8d6f2f0a8b9403d.mp4?t=1689506741\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2016960/extras/b09be27ca95b783340babf29a7d6188d.avif?t=1689506741\" /></div><br><br>Viewers can also use the !bomb command to drop bombs on the battlefield during combat and the !cam command to change viewpoint. <br>Winning viewers can increase their in-game points and compete for rankings.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2016960/extras/0274b6cad46d7185dc08f99a889903ab.avif?t=1689506741\" /></div>",
